<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23156" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">infĕrĭae</span></b> ,
			ārum, f.
		plur. [inferi], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>sacrifices in honor of the dead</i> (class.);
				nom., <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 13, 613</span></i>; abl.,
				<i><span class="en">id. Ib.
				454</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alicui inferias afferre,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					N. D. 3, 16, 42</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">absenti ferat inferias,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 9, 215</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">referre,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 2, 1, 28</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alicui dare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					5, 422</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mittere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					M. 11, 381</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">accipere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 8, 488</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inferias alicui facere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					2, 95</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inferias his annua religione instituit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Calig. 15</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Claud. 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Vit. 11 al.</span></i></div>
